  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at 2.34.1 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### ⬆️ Dependency Updates\n* Bump org.junit:junit-bom from 5.12.0 to 5.13.0 by @dependabot in https://github.com/allure-framework/allure2/pull/3006\n* Bump com.github.spotbugs from 6.1.7 to 6.1.13 by @dependabot in https://github.com/allure-framework/allure2/pull/3003\n* Bump org.apache.commons:commons-collections4 from 4.4 to 4.5.0 by @dependabot in https://github.com/allure-framework/allure2/pull/2969\n* Bump org.projectlombok:lombok from 1.18.36 to 1.18.38 by @dependabot in https://github.com/allure-framework/allure2/pull/2968\n* Bump commons-io:commons-io from 2.18.0 to 2.19.0 by @dependabot in https://github.com/allure-framework/allure2/pull/2966\n* Bump commons-beanutils:commons-beanutils from 1.10.1 to 1.11.0 by @dependabot in https://github.com/allure-framework/allure2/pull/3007\n* Bump org.apache.tika:tika-core from 2.9.3 to 2.9.4 by @dependabot in https://github.com/allure-framework/allure2/pull/3014\n* Fix npm vulnerabilities by @epszaw in https://github.com/allure-framework/allure2/pull/3026\n* Bump com.fasterxml.jackson:jackson-bom from 2.18.3 to 2.19.1 by @dependabot in https://github.com/allure-framework/allure2/pull/3024\n* Bump org.mockito:mockito-core from 5.17.0 to 5.18.0 by @dependabot in https://github.com/allure-framework/allure2/pull/3011\n* Bump com.diffplug.spotless from 7.0.3 to 7.0.4 by @dependabot in https://github.com/allure-framework/allure2/pull/3010\n* Bump comSquareupRetrofit2Version from 2.11.0 to 3.0.0 by @dependabot in https://github.com/allure-framework/allure2/pull/3012\n* Bump autoprefixer and browserslist by @epszaw in https://github.com/allure-framework/allure2/pull/3030\n* Bump net.sourceforge.pmd:pmd-java from 7.12.0 to 7.14.0 by @dependabot in https://github.com/allure-framework/allure2/pull/3013\n* Bump com.puppycrawl.tools:checkstyle from 10.23.0 to 10.25.1 by @dependabot in https://github.com/allure-framework/allure2/pull/3035\n* Bump org.owasp.dependencycheck from 12.1.1 to 12.1.3 by @dependabot in https://github.com/allure-framework/allure2/pull/3034\n* Bump org.junit:junit-bom from 5.13.0 to 5.13.1 by @dependabot in https://github.com/allure-framework/allure2/pull/3033\n* Bump @babel/runtime from 7.24.4 to 7.27.0 in /allure-generator by @dependabot in https://github.com/allure-framework/allure2/pull/2950\n* Bump com.github.spotbugs from 6.1.13 to 6.2.0 by @dependabot in https://github.com/allure-framework/allure2/pull/3031\n### ⛔️ Security\n* fix xee by @baev in https://github.com/allure-framework/allure2/pull/3029\n\n## New Contributors\n* @epszaw made their first contribution in https://github.com/allure-framework/allure2/pull/3026\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/allure-framework/allure2/compare/2.34.0...2.34.1",
